<!DOCTYPE Bill PUBLIC "-//LSC//DTD Authoring Bill XML//EN" "l:\dtd\author\billauthoring.top"><Bill version="1.0" type="introLN" docName="H-1071.1"><IntroducedBillHeader><RequestNumber>H-1071.1</RequestNumber><BillNumber>HOUSE BILL 1684</BillNumber><StateLegSession><State>State of Washington</State><Legislature>60th Legislature</Legislature><Session>2007 Regular Session</Session></StateLegSession><Sponsors>Representatives Orcutt and VanDeWege</Sponsors><IntroHistory><ReadDate>Read first time 01/24/2007.  </ReadDate><ReferredTo>Referred to Committee on Finance.</ReferredTo></IntroHistory></IntroducedBillHeader><BriefDescription>Modifying the effective and expiration dates for the clean fuel sales and use tax exemptions.</BriefDescription><BillBody><BillTitle><LineNumber line=" 1" page="1,1" hrt="no"/>	AN ACT Relating to effective and expiration dates for the clean<LineNumber line=" 2" page="1,2"/>fuel sales and use tax exemptions; amending 2005 c 296 s 5<LineNumber line=" 3" page="1,3"/>(uncodified); and amending 2005 c 296 s 6 (uncodified).</BillTitle><EnactingClause><LineNumber line=" 4" page="1,4" hrt="no"/>BE IT ENACTED BY THE LEGISLATURE OF THE STATE OF WASHINGTON:</EnactingClause><BillSection type="uncod"><LineNumber line=" 5" page="1,5" hrt="no"/><BegSecAmd><SecNum>Sec. </SecNum><BegSecText>2005 c 296 s 5 (uncodified) is amended to read as follows:</BegSecText><LineNumber line=" 6" page="1,6" hrt="no"/></BegSecAmd><RCWSLText>	This act takes effect ((<strike>January 1, 2009</strike>)) <add>August 1, 2007</add>.</RCWSLText></BillSection><BillSection type="uncod"><LineNumber line=" 7" page="1,7" hrt="no"/><BegSecAmd><SecNum>Sec. </SecNum><BegSecText>2005 c 296 s 6 (uncodified) is amended to read as follows:</BegSecText><LineNumber line=" 8" page="1,8" hrt="no"/></BegSecAmd><RCWSLText>	This act expires ((<strike>January 1, 2011</strike>)) <add>June 30, 2017</add>.</RCWSLText></BillSection><BillEnd>--- END ---<PageNumberFooter lastpage="yes">		p. 1	HB 1684</PageNumberFooter></BillEnd></BillBody></Bill>